[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m   git -C libDaisy status\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'git -C libDaisy status'\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'git -C libDaisy status' (Persist to settings.json)\r\n  4. No, cancel\r\n\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mctrl+g\u001b[90;22m edit/expand command · \u001b[94;1mctrl+r\u001b[90;22m Review\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[80X\u001b[80C\u001b[2mGemini 3.8 Flash · high\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
